g dahulu.\n\nImage: Tenant checking Desa Green rental listing details before viewing\n\nTenantQuick Answer\n\n# Desa Green KL: Panduan Sewa, Viewing dan Commute [2026]\n\nPublished 8 July 2026 · Updated 22 September 2026 · SPEEDHOME\n\n## Apakah pilihan sewa semasa di Desa Green?\n\nFeed Desa Green semasa platform ini di Taman Desa menyenaraikan campuran unit furnished dan unfurnished dalam servis apartmen freehold 3-menara oleh UOA Development Bhd, pada sewa strata KL rendah-ke-sederhana. Sewa minta pada feed live bermula sekitar RM1,400/bulan dan naik ikut saiz, tingkat, furnishing dan parking — semak listing live untuk angka peringkat-unit.\n\nDikemas kini terakhir 24 Jun 2026 oleh pasukan editorial SPEEDHOME.\n\nDesa Green terletak dalam Taman Desa, alamat KL yang sudah lama wujud di selatan pusat bandar, sesuai untuk pemandu dan e-hailing antara Jalan Klang Lama dan Lebuhraya Persekutuan. Rekod awam kenal pasti pemaju sebagai UOA Development Bhd, di atas tapak freehold seluas kira-kira 3 ekar, dengan 3 menara berjumlah kira-kira 1,388 unit kesemuanya (Tower 1 ~486 unit, Tower 2 ~451 unit, Tower 3 ~451 unit — pecahan tepat per menara sedikit berbeza antara sumber portal, jadi anggap sebagai anggaran sahaja), saiz binaan kira-kira 578-945 kaki persegi, disiapkan sekitar 2016. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDesa Green Serviced Apartments, KL: Rent, Commute & Viewing (2026) (https://speedhome.com/blog/desa-green/)\nciteturn270search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3 months ago; Crawled: today; Public building records show it was developed by UOA Development Bhd on a freehold site of roughly 3 acres, comprising 3 towers with about 1,388 units in total (Tower 1 ~486 units, Tower 2 ~451 units, Tower 3 ~451 units — the exact per-tower split shifts slightly between portal sources, so treat it as an approximate mix), with built-up sizes running roughly 578-945 sq ft, completed around 2016. ... SPEEDHOME's current Desa Green feed lists a mix of furnished and unfurnished units starting around RM1,400/month; the trade-offs are older-block fit and finish, possible water pressure variation on upper floors, and a parking ratio that usually caps at one bay per unit.\n\nImage: Tenant checking Desa Green rental listing details before viewing\n\n\n# Desa Green, KL: Asking Rent, Viewing & Commute [2026]\n\nPublished 20 June 2026 · SPEEDHOME\n\n## Quick answer\n\nSPEEDHOME's current Desa Green feed in Taman Desa lists a mix of furnished and unfurnished units at low-to-mid KL strata rent. Asking rent on the live feed starts around RM1,400/month and rises with size, floor, furnishing and parking — check the live listing for the unit-level figure.\n\nLast updated 7 July 2026 by the SPEEDHOME editorial team.\n\nDesa Green — sometimes listed on property portals as Desa Green Serviced Apartments, the same building under a marketing name, not a separate development — sits inside Taman Desa, an established KL address south of the city centre, well placed for drivers and e-hailing between Jalan Klang Lama and the Federal Highway. Public building records show it was developed by UOA Development Bhd on a freehold site of roughly 3 acres, comprising 3 towers with about 1,388 units in total (Tower 1 ~486 units, Tower 2 ~451 units, Tower 3 ~451 units — the exact per-tower split shifts slightly between portal sources, so treat it as an approximate mix), with built-up sizes running roughly 578-945 sq ft, completed around 2016. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunway Velocity 3 | Cheras, Malaysia | Rumavi (https://rumavi.com/en/new-developments/malaysia/cheras/sunway-velocity-3)\nciteturn270search9 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; 1604 units ... Sunway Property's institutional governance, 50-year development history, and consistent on-time delivery record position this as one of the lowest-risk residential investments in the 2028 KL South pipeline. ... Sunway Velocity 3 is developed by Sunway Property, founded in 1974 and 100+ projects completed.\n\nMRT-Linked Integrated Township\n\nRM 580,000 - RM 600,000\n\n1 / 6\n\n# Sunway Velocity 3 — Condo in Cheras\n\nby Sunway Property · Cheras, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia\n\nQ2 2028\n\nCompletion\n\n45 floors\n\nFloors\n\n2\n\nBuildings\n\n1604 units\n\nTotal Units\n\n### RUMAVI Expert Analysis\n\nIndependent assessment by the RUMAVI editorial team\n\n#### Investment Highlights\n\nSunway Velocity 3 benefits from the full maturity and brand equity of the Sunway Velocity integrated township — a development that has consistently outperformed broader Cheras residential pricing across multiple phases. The direct covered link to Cochrane MRT Station on the Putrajaya Line, combined with in-precinct access to Sunway Velocity Mall 2 and Sunway Medical Centre Velocity, creates a car-free integrated living proposition that commands a sustainable premium over non-integrated alternatives in the KL South corridor. Entry pricing from $171,000 for studios to $288,000 for three-bedroom units serves the broad professional and medical worker demographic that anchors occupancy in the Velocity precinct. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunway Velocity 3 E-Brochure Preview FA (https://ipp1-cdn.pgimgs.com/projectnet-project/221688/ZPBRO.159540854.pdf)\nciteturn270search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2.4 years ago; Developer: Sunway Velocity Three Sdn Bhd (1054953-V) • Address: The Property Gallery, Lobby Level, Menara Sunway, Jalan Lagoon Timur, Bandar Sunway, 47500 Petaling Jaya, Selangor Darul Ehsan • Type: Service Apartment • Developer's License: 30685/01-2029/0027(A) • Validity Period: 24 Jan 2024 till 23 Jan 2029 • Advertising Permit: 30685-1/04-2027/0328(N)-(S)\n• Validity Period: 19 Apr 2024 till 18 Apr 2027 • Building Plan Approval No: BPU3OSC20230103 • Approving Authority: Dewan Bandaraya Kuala Lumpur • Tenure: Leasehold (expiry 11/01/2121) • Expected